","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2505.24384:I003","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_obligation_or_hypothesis","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2505.24384:I003:U001","2505.24384:I003:U002","2505.24384:I003:U003","2505.24384:I003:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U002","ISSUE-002:U003","ISSUE-002:U006"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue is an overbroad Caffarelli boundary-regularity statement: C2 boundaries are insufficient for the claimed C^{q+2,alpha} order and its downstream uses. ISSUE-002 identifies a separate q=0 estimator-consistency hypothesis gap and does not diagnose the boundary smoothness mismatch or its high-order consequences.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2505.24384:I005","focus_prediction_issue_id":"ISSUE-002","focus_relation":"different_causal_subject","gold_causal_unit_ids":["2505.24384:I005:U001","2505.24384:I005:U002","2505.24384:I005:U003","2505.24384:I005:U005"],"prediction_causal_unit_ids":["ISSUE-002:U001","ISSUE-002:U003","ISSUE-002:U006"],"same_causal_subject":false,"same_failed_obligation":false,"same_failure_operation":false,"identity_explanation":"The gold issue concerns measurable choices and Borelness of truncation and pushforward operations needed to define an adapted process. ISSUE-002 concerns smoothness and Fisher-information assumptions for estimator consistency, with no recognition of measurability or adaptedness.","shared_mathematical_weakness":"","uncovered_gold_detail":"","coverage_status":"not_matched","supporting_prediction_issue_ids":[],"combination_explanation":"","component_coverage":[]},{"gold_issue_id":"2505.243